+	// a waiting request whose client leaves frees its place in the queue at once (carmona patch)
+	// ponytail: the callback also runs, and finds nothing to drop, for a request that waited and then ran to its end
+	// (one short goroutine per queued request); call the stop func of AfterFunc when a worker takes the request
